; Expect: FreeSound: the sound is 0
; A debug build (-d) stops FreeSound on the 0 of a sound that failed to load. Other builds ignore it.
If GetEnv$("BLITZ_SUITE_DEBUG") = "" Then RuntimeError("FreeSound: the sound is 0 (release build, not checked).")
snd = LoadSound("does_not_exist.wav")
FreeSound snd
Print "FreeSound did not stop the program."
